menu "BedJet Matter Bridge"

    config APP_WIFI_OTA
        bool "OTA updates from GitHub over Wi-Fi (spike)"
        default n
        depends on ENABLE_WIFI_STATION
        help
            Check the GitHub latest release for an app-only image and apply it with
            esp_https_ota over the Wi-Fi LAN. Wi-Fi transport only. See
            SPIKE-MATTER-WIFI.md. Off by default until validated on hardware.

endmenu
